label demo_poseidon:
    scene bg_black
    medusa "Athena had offered to walk me back to my dorm after our board game session." # VA: Internal monologue, reflective.
    medusa "But I'd said no." # VA: Internal monologue, firm but conflicted.
    medusa "We'd been paired up enough for the day, and I wanted to be alone." # VA: Internal monologue, guarded.
    medusa "Besides..." # VA: Internal monologue, hesitant pause.
    medusa "I didn't want her to wear out her welcome just yet." # VA: Internal monologue, self-protective.
    medusa "..." # VA: Quiet beat.
    play sound medusa_hallway_footsteps
    show bg_cold_hallway with dissolve
    show sprite_medusa_sad at Position(xalign=0.3) with dissolve
    medusa "Just yet." # VA: Internal monologue, reaffirming distance.
    medusa "Athena had smiled at me when I said that." # VA: Internal monologue, surprised by her kindness.
    medusa "I thought it was harsh to say that now..." # VA: Internal monologue, guilty reflection.
    medusa "But she didn't mind." # VA: Internal monologue, softened.
    pause 1.0
    medusa "She was persistent with me." # VA: Internal monologue, reluctant admiration.
    medusa "I had to give her credit there." # VA: Internal monologue, honest concession.
    medusa "Besides her father, everyone else had given up on me." # VA: Internal monologue, hurt memory.
    medusa "Nobody else seemed to acknowledge me on campus..." # VA: Internal monologue, lonely bitterness.
    medusa "Well..." # VA: Internal monologue, tense lead-in.
    medusa "Except for the person I dreaded seeing most..." # VA: Internal monologue, rising dread.
    scene bg_black with fade
    play sound medusa_hallway_footsteps
    pause 2.0
    show sprite_poseidon_neutral at Position(xalign=0.7)
    pause 2.0
    medusa "Poseidon." # VA: Internal monologue, heavy and cold.
    medusa "Professor Poseidon." # VA: Internal monologue, bitter formality.
    medusa "Campus legend. Sporting icon. Beloved by everyone." # VA: Internal monologue, resentful list.
    pause 2.0
    medusa "...And someone who I could never shake the feeling was an especially evil son of a bitch, underneath it all." # VA: Internal monologue, disgust and fear.
    medusa "What's worse, he had his eye on me." # VA: Internal monologue, dread.
    medusa "I knew that." # VA: Internal monologue, certainty.
    scene bg_black with Fade(3.0)
    pause 1.0
    scene bg_cold_hallway with dissolve
    show sprite_medusa_angry_left at Position(xalign=0.7)
    show sprite_poseidon_neutral at Position(xalign=0.3)
    medusa "Even while my back was turned, I felt him watching me." # VA: Internal monologue, paranoia grounded in fear.
    medusa "Like a bloated shark might do when sizing up its prey..." # VA: Internal monologue, vivid contempt.
    medusa "Wondering if an extra morsel was worth the stomach-ache." # VA: Internal monologue, dark metaphor.
    pause 1.0
    scene bg_black with fade
    medusa "I hated that." # VA: Internal monologue, clenched anger.
    medusa "Hated feeling so weak." # VA: Internal monologue, self-directed frustration.
    medusa "Hated that someone could have so much power over my mind." # VA: Internal monologue, raw and shaken.
    medusa "Hated." # VA: Internal monologue, pounding emphasis.
    medusa "Hated." # VA: Internal monologue, repeated fury.
    medusa "Hated it." # VA: Internal monologue, final bitter release.
    show cg_medusa_door with dissolve
    medusa "Even by the time I'd reached my room, I couldn't help but feel he was still watching me." # VA: Internal monologue, lingering fear.
    medusa "Still waiting." # VA: Internal monologue, quiet dread.
    medusa "Still pestering." # VA: Internal monologue, exhausted resentment.
    medusa "Ready for any chance to claw his dirty fingertips deep into my harsh, green skin." # VA: Internal monologue, visceral revulsion.
    scene bg_black with fade
    pause 2.0
    return